{"id":"f276735320c6ad44","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-fixed-point-model.md","title":"部分固定点模型与经典闭合模型","display":"df-fixed-point-model — 部分固定点模型与经典闭合模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-fixed-point-model","aliases":["91-df-fixed-point-model","91-df-Kripke-model"],"display":"df-fixed-point-model — 部分固定点模型与经典闭合模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-truth-expansion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-fixed-point-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-fixed-point-model</span><span>91-df-Kripke-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-model — 部分固定点模型与经典闭合模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f5043d4200f56d1\" href=\"?note=7f5043d4200f56d1\" title=\"91-df-truth-expansion\">91-df-truth-expansion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}\">\\(X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 为标准基础结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,X,X^-),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,X,X^-),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,T\\mapsto X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,T\\mapsto X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分结构需要正、负两套数据；旧版把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,X)\">\\((\\mathbb N,X)\\)</span> 同时当作三值与经典结构。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}\\)</span> 验证 KF加CONS。两种结构解释同一外延但对未定真理原子的外部否定不同：经典闭合模型把未入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的代码判为“不真”，部分模型保持间隙。\n本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^-\">\\(X^-\\)</span> 只记句子代码上的反信息；原书 Λ 固定点的完整反外延是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N\\setminus C_T)\\cup X^-\">\\((\\mathbb N\\setminus C_T)\\cup X^-\\)</span>。因为本地三值满足对子句“非句子值”已另设判假，两种负集给出相同句子评估。经典闭包始终采用通常二值满足。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmata 15.13–15.14、Theorem 15.15、Lemma 15.17，印刷页 195–199，PDF 页 206–210。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v_X$ 见 [[91-df-truth-value-function]]；$\\mathcal N$ 为标准基础结构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,X,X^-),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal N,T\\mapsto X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_X\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\rm cl}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X^-","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N\\setminus C_T)\\cup X^-","display":false}],"bytes":1808,"backlinks":[{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c096df80861122dd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[9